{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/7c56e5bffe4ee2f6207bfd7a3a904d02.avif?t=1773576737\" width=300 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Unknown. Unseen. Unidentified.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mike is the main character,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > a journalist always chasing the story behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > He gains access to an apartment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > where a family once lived and was killed by someone whose identity remains unknown,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > which is a terrible incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cScreaming In The Basement\u201d\u00a0</strong></i>is a first-person psychological horror game, delving into an evil rooted beyond<strong> </strong>darkness, a realistic and immersive horror atmosphere. an investigative reporter called Mike investigates a tragic family murder committed by a serial killer. Strange things from <strong>1991</strong> occur. This game is inspired by P.T.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/648242b4786558d2e65deb51373d4d5b.poster.avif?t=1773576737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/648242b4786558d2e65deb51373d4d5b.webm?t=1773576737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/648242b4786558d2e65deb51373d4d5b.mp4?t=1773576737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D surround sound</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1990s Aesthetic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polaroid Camera Mechanic</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Average playtime: 70 minutes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/8360f7392935c7267f4987804a3c0a7c.poster.avif?t=1773576737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/8360f7392935c7267f4987804a3c0a7c.webm?t=1773576737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441360/extras/8360f7392935c7267f4987804a3c0a7c.mp4?t=1773576737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/df97ebe17628b235a9410485c953b26fd5da2c5e.jpg"},{"name":"The Dream Is Weird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/35f3fe52debcc14440e72b74e50333be0f3692e2.jpg"},{"name":"You see Frank, Sarah\u2019s father","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441360/c85b19e15fb8f5082e91311bba0d4f79edab6418.jpg"},{"name":"Martha","path":